  Spawn failed
  2 of 3 spawned branches failed. Choose what to do with the failed branches.

› 1. Continue:  Resume with each failed branch's existing context.
  2. Retry:     Start each failed branch again in a new agent.
  3. Abandon:   Return the failures to the parent agent.

  Press enter to confirm
